Based on the described scene, here is the RDF turtle representation and a summary of the identified risks:

Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Foggy weather with rain impacts visibility and road conditions" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk2 .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Heavy rainfall affecting visibility and increasing stopping distance" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Wet road surface increasing the risk of skidding" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .
